{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies. Guns. Bodycam. ZOMBIECAM blends realism and immersion in a well paced first person shooter arena experience. Fight against hordes of zombies in round-based  arena environments, achieve in-level weapon unlocks and use explosives and the environment to your advantage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What to expect: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LEVELS: Map environments look and feel authentic with realistic lighting and effects. Some photorealistic assets are already in the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COMBAT: Expect zombie hordes to be bigger and more diverse throughout each round. Apex zombies will be harder to kill. Use the layout of the arena to your advantage and use the right weapon for each horde situation you are in.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WEAPONS: Weapons feel powerful and do the job of reducing the horde. Unlock more weapons are the initial rounds go by.\u00a0Axe, Revolver, AK47, Shotgun, Flamethrower, Molotov cocktails and SMG are already in the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HUD: ZOMBIECAM is aiming for a realistic display with no HUD other then the bodycam-style border. Temporary blood on screen when taking damage. The overall display of the game leans towards realism along with lifelike audio effects as well.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NIGHTVISON MODE: Some levels will have a separate nightvision mode that can be played at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CHAMBER OF PAIN: An open level with  scattered bouncepads. Adds an extra dimension to the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to start a discussion! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coming Soon. Wishlist now on Steam. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press and Inquiries: <a href=\"mailto:contact@zombiecamgame.com\">contact@zombiecamgame.com</a></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2865350?t=1772056235","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865350/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772056235","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865350/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772056235","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865350/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772056235","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Contains strong violence and blood and gore."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies. Guns. Bodycam. ZOMBIECAM blends realism and immersion in a well paced first person shooter arena experience. Fight against hordes of zombies in round-based  arena environments, achieve in-level weapon unlocks and use explosives and the environment to your advantage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What to expect: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LEVELS: Map environments look and feel authentic with realistic lighting and effects. Some photorealistic assets are already in the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COMBAT: Expect zombie hordes to be bigger and more diverse throughout each round. Apex zombies will be harder to kill. Use the layout of the arena to your advantage and use the right weapon for each horde situation you are in.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WEAPONS: Weapons feel powerful and do the job of reducing the horde. Unlock more weapons are the initial rounds go by.\u00a0Axe, Revolver, AK47, Shotgun, Flamethrower, Molotov cocktails and SMG are already in the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HUD: ZOMBIECAM is aiming for a realistic display with no HUD other then the bodycam-style border. Temporary blood on screen when taking damage. The overall display of the game leans towards realism along with lifelike audio effects as well.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NIGHTVISON MODE: Some levels will have a separate nightvision mode that can be played at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CHAMBER OF PAIN: An open level with  scattered bouncepads. Adds an extra dimension to the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to start a discussion! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coming Soon. Wishlist now on Steam. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press and Inquiries: <a href=\"mailto:contact@zombiecamgame.com\">contact@zombiecamgame.com</a></p>","developers":["ZOMBIECAM Crew"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865350/header.jpg?t=1772056235","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2865350/801345397/3990b43d746688f1958d4abbbbde1e095760d2ff/1751427075/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751430730","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2865350/801345397/3990b43d746688f1958d4abbbbde1e095760d2ff/1751427075/dash_h264.mpd?t=1751430730","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2865350/801345397/3990b43d746688f1958d4abbbbde1e095760d2ff/1751427075/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1751430730","id":257164298,"name":"ZOMBIECAM 2025 TRAILER","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c